Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRoadObstruction" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :fog1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasObstacle :vehicle1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle encroaching on road lane in dense fog" .

:fog1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle detected in ego-lane under poor visibility conditions causing lane intrusion risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane intrusion risk due to a vehicle occupying the ego-lane in dense fog, significantly reducing reaction time and visibility.
Severity Score: 0.75